{"4385490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Steal Shift", "steam_appid": 4385490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385490/extras/2a83e980fc297917b9daa0b2c2e69bea.webp?t=1774982513\" width=278 height=61 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to your Steal Shift !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You work night shifts in an abandoned industrial facility where <strong>everything that arrives is not exactly yours</strong>. Your job is simple, <strong>steal items, process them, broke machines, fix machines, print money, extract, repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385490/extras/0842f4bd66cf9a962da9145ec105d39e.poster.avif?t=1774982513\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385490/extras/0842f4bd66cf9a962da9145ec105d39e.webm?t=1774982513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385490/extras/0842f4bd66cf9a962da9145ec105d39e.mp4?t=1774982513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385490/extras/874e56cc2de0639f057829370da407f5.webp?t=1774982513\" width=315 height=19 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">You have only have 10 minutes to steal everything...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think fast. Think smart. Make risky decisions, manage the chaos, and steal as much as you can before the shift ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385490/extras/ad60e56cd5619ce6a92c01e0de52dec2.poster.avif?t=1774982513\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385490/extras/ad60e56cd5619ce6a92c01e0de52dec2.webm?t=1774982513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385490/extras/ad60e56cd5619ce6a92c01e0de52dec2.mp4?t=1774982513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385490/extras/d35404dacf395d1667299ece08aaf42c.avif?t=1774982513\" width=231 height=105 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Trust the Printer. It knows what to do.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dirty money fuels the factory. Clean money must be printed and extracted to keep it. Mixing them up can cost you a run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385490/extras/520ff815385aa909fd3476c8ed207e18.poster.avif?t=1774982513\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385490/extras/520ff815385aa909fd3476c8ed207e18.webm?t=1774982513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385490/extras/520ff815385aa909fd3476c8ed207e18.mp4?t=1774982513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385490/extras/6e8774ad027e7d6d76a7f5ddcc797d15.avif?t=1774982513\" width=419 height=68 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Printer Needs Paper !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To print clean money, you first need to <strong>create paper</strong> by shredding items, Trash items give little paper, Eco friendly items give more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385490/extras/948291c825c077c7ce78ac59879a081f.poster.avif?t=1774982513\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385490/extras/948291c825c077c7ce78ac59879a081f.webm?t=1774982513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385490/extras/948291c825c077c7ce78ac59879a081f.mp4?t=1774982513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Early Access Warning</strong><br>This game is still in active development.<br>Features, balance, visuals, and mechanics may change  as new updates roll out.</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4385490/extras/2a83e980fc297917b9daa0b2c2e69bea.webp?t=1774982513\" width=278 height=61 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to your Steal Shift !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" sty